sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Customer / UI
    participant P1 as Booking workflow
    participant P2 as Payments / ledger
    participant P3 as Gateway
    participant P4 as Outbox / worker
    Note over P0,P4: 1 / Verified capture — common path
    P0->>P1: Hold and accept actor-owned quote
    P1->>P2: Persist intent + stable operation key
    P2->>P3: Initialize outside DB transaction
    P3->>P0: Redirect customer to selected gateway
    P3->>P2: Untrusted callback signal; dedup inbox
    P2->>P3: Server verify merchant / exact unit / amount
    P3->>P2: Verified capture; unique transaction reference
    P2->>P1: Durable PaymentCaptured workflow
    Note over P0,P4: ALT A / Valid hold at DB-clock decision
    P1->>P1: Lock resources > booking/hold > balance
    P1->>P0: Apply capture + CONFIRMED + history/outbox
    Note over P0,P4: ALT B / Hold expired, changed revision or conflict — never execute A and B together
    P1->>P2: No resurrection; mark unapplied compensation
    P2->>P3: Full unapplied refund/void; reconcile UNKNOWN
    Note over P0,P4: 2 / Separate later flow — cancellation of an actually confirmed booking
    P0->>P1: Request cancellation using accepted terms
    P1->>P2: Calculate entitlement; lock refund budget
    P2->>P4: Reserve funds + refund request outbox
    P4->>P3: Refund outside locks; stable refund ID
    P3->>P2: Verified success or UNKNOWN reservation retained
    P2->>P4: RefundCompleted only after verified success
